      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "TIN LIDS (6) could not have been more impressive a few runs back in her dynamic 22.09 win at this track over 390m then has finished in the placings in both runs since. Looks the one to beat on best figures. WHERE'S MICK (8) failed to feature last start after settling well back at this track, but prior to that won by a neck at this track (22.50) beating Adrenaline Burst in a Mix 6/7 on August 6. Great chance to atone. THRILL SEEKER (1) carved over from wide out and boxed on strongly to finish 1.3 lengths away in third (26.24) behind Aussie Fernando at this track. Expected to be in this for a long way. ALL STRUTTED UP (2) will be hard to beat with a drop in distance.",
